=========================================
🛡️ HealthGuard AI - Smart Healthcare Portal
=========================================

HealthGuard AI is a premium, secure electronic medical record (EMR) and disease risk prediction portal. The system uses clinical vital assessments, automated diagnosis tracking, and Gemini AI analysis to predict health metrics and consolidate detailed patient health reports.

