-----------------------------------------
💻 TECHNICAL STACK
-----------------------------------------

• Frontend: React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion, Axios, React Query, Lucide Icons
• Backend API: Node.js, Express, Supabase (PostgreSQL), JWT Authorization
• Machine Learning: FastAPI, Python (Scikit-Learn models for disease risk prediction)
• Generative AI: Google Gemini AI (Clinical report extraction & triage evaluations)

-----------------------------------------
🌟 KEY FEATURES
-----------------------------------------

• Secure Provider/Clinician Authentication & Isolated Dashboards
• Interactive "Made with Love" Developer Showcase Modal
• Multi-Patient Directory & Family Member Management
• Real-time Machine Learning Health Risk Predictions (Diabetes, Cardiovascular, Stroke)
• Automated EMR Generation & PDF Report Downloading
• Google Gemini AI-powered Symptom Checker & Clinical Recommendation Engine
